        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "<div style='font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;color:#c7ccd6;border-left:3px solid #5b7db1;padding:2px 8px'>Source: <code>honeylens.pipeline_stats</code> (one row per batch + a heartbeat every 30 s). These metrics describe HoneyLens itself, not attackers. Times in IST.</div>"
